  "steps": [
    "Rinse the sprouted matki and keep aside.",
    "Heat the oil in a pot, crackle the mustard seeds, then add hing and curry leaves.",
    "Add the onion and cook until golden, then add the ginger garlic paste and tomato and cook until soft.",
    "Stir in turmeric, red chilli powder and goda masala for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the sprouts, salt and 1.5 cups of hot water, cover and cook for 12-15 minutes until the sprouts are tender but not mushy.",
    "Add the jaggery and grated coconut, simmer for 3 minutes, and finish with coriander leaves."
  ]
